    C3("CAPABILITY-GATE · this repo<br/>3 · Decides before the tool runs<br/>ALLOW · ASK · ISOLATE · DENY<br/>logged to a hash chain")
    T4("AEGIS-ATOMS<br/>4 · Reads the gate's decision<br/>may tighten it, never loosens it")
    H5["HOST · 5a<br/>ALLOW runs<br/>ASK waits for a person<br/>DENY is blocked"]
    I5["ISOLATION-LAYER · 5b<br/>ISOLATE goes here<br/>a microVM per task<br/>research build · CI runs its stub door"]
    A6(["AGENT<br/>6 · Gets the result<br/>or the reason it was blocked"])
    O7["OVERSIGHT<br/>7 · Audit the chain<br/>report what was used but not granted"]
    P8[/"PEOPLE<br/>8 · Grant it or keep it denied<br/>move from observe to enforce<br/>then back to step 1"/]

    P1 -.->|"read at load"| C3
